{"n": 575, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "575.webp", "text": "32-7b\n\n3213503 DISASSEMBLING/ASSEMBLING\nPOWER STEERING GEAR\n— POWER STEERING GEAR\nREMOVED\n\nRemove and install tie rods 32 21 251.\nWorking on steering gears requires utmost care\nand cleanliness.\n\nDisconnect lines.\nPull off leak oil line.\n\n10327055\n\nUnscrew bolts.\nTake off cover (34), spring (32) and washer (33).\n\n3032056\n\nScrew self-tapping screw in bore and pull out\npressure piece (30).\n\n3032057\n\nPull protective cap (64) off of steering spindle\nstub\n\nTurn steering to straight ahead (take half of\ntotal steering wheel turns)\n\nMark position of steering spindie (81), valve\nhousing (59) and case (1) to each other in this\nPosition.\n\nUnscrew bolts.\n\nPull steering spindle (81) and valve housing (59)\nout of case.\n\n3032059\n\nMack position of cylindrical tube (22) and case\n(1) to each other.\n\nUnscrew round nut (19) with Special Tool\n321110.\n\nRemove cylindrical tube.\n\nPull rack (3) out of case.\n\n3032061", "words": [["32-7b", 0.4635, 0.0272, 0.5299, 0.0517], ["3213503", 0.2604, 0.065, 0.309, 0.0763], ["DISASSEMBLING/ASSEMBLING", 0.3222, 0.0656, 0.4858, 0.0776], ["POWER", 0.3222, 0.0816, 0.3592, 0.0928], ["STEERING", 0.3632, 0.0816, 0.4184, 0.0928], ["GEAR", 0.4225, 0.0822, 0.4529, 0.0928], ["—", 0.3232, 0.1034, 0.3288, 0.1054], ["POWER", 0.3328, 0.0975, 0.3703, 0.1088], ["STEERING", 0.3744, 0.0981, 0.4296, 0.1094], ["GEAR", 0.4336, 0.0981, 0.464, 0.1094], ["REMOVED", 0.3222, 0.1141, 0.3769, 0.1247], ["Remove", 0.2604, 0.1459, 0.2984, 0.1565], ["and", 0.3019, 0.1459, 0.3191, 0.1565], ["install", 0.3232, 0.1399, 0.3501, 0.1631], ["tie", 0.3541, 0.1399, 0.3678, 0.1631], ["rods", 0.3693, 0.1466, 0.3891, 0.1565], ["32", 0.3926, 0.1459, 0.4043, 0.1565], ["21", 0.4083, 0.1459, 0.4184, 0.1565], ["251.", 0.423, 0.1459, 0.4438, 0.1565], ["Working", 0.2594, 0.1618, 0.2999, 0.1744], ["on", 0.3029, 0.1645, 0.3151, 0.1724], ["steering", 0.3181, 0.1631, 0.3546, 0.1751], ["gears", 0.3